{"overview":"بعد از نابودی منطقه ی دوازده و فرار کتنیس و دوستانش از دست کاپیتول، آن ها به منطقه ی سیزده می روند که در زیر زمین جای گرفته شده. جنگ و شورش در منطقه های دیگر بر علیه کاپیتول بالا گرفته و تنها امید و سمبل مردم کتنیس است که به عنوان ماکینجی (مرغ مقلد) باید زنده بماند، اما کتنیس هدف های دیگری هم دارد که یکی از آن ها نجات پیتاست...","tagline":"","overview_en":"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.","tagline_en":"Fire burns brighter in the darkness.","runtime":123,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["فرانسیس لارنس"],"crew_en":["Francis Lawrence"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"جنیفر لارنس","role":"Katniss Everdeen","photo":"/6WTY6HjXMGxnHilJRVC3eLnu43F.jpg","en":"Jennifer Lawrence"},{"name":"جاش هاچرسون","role":"Peeta Mellark","photo":"/f0eosZ1Fx0VBUyspq8K2f8sUSBn.jpg","en":"Josh Hutcherson"},{"name":"لیام همسورث","role":"Gale Hawthorne","photo":"/As5ujeSSJRQN4TE3odg3kDk0b5o.jpg","en":"Liam Hemsworth"},{"name":"وودی هارلسون","role":"Haymitch Abernathy","photo":"/igxYDQBbTEdAqaJxaW6ffqswmUU.jpg","en":"Woody Harrelson"},{"name":"الیزابت بنکس","role":"Effie Trinket","photo":"/wMDFt9PUdxJWBzTwixiBfNpeN89.jpg","en":"Elizabeth Banks"},{"name":"جولین مور","role":"President Alma Coin","photo":"/3YF19rWusxWfEI59ZM33dFhasRq.jpg","en":"Julianne Moore"},{"name":"فیلیپ سیمور هافمن","role":"Plutarch Heavensbee","photo":"/50rqDkmvXwjwVhFH7q6ph2Rkw7S.jpg","en":"Philip Seymour Hoffman"},{"name":"جفری رایت","role":"Beetee Latier","photo":"/yGcuHGW4glqRpOPxgiCvjcren7F.jpg","en":"Jeffrey Wright"},{"name":"استنلی توچی","role":"Caesar Flickerman","photo":"/q4TanMDI5Rgsvw